{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21945","headline":"折劒头 · 白居易","name":"折劒头","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拾得折劒头，不知折之由。\n一握青蛇尾，数寸碧峰头。\n疑是斩鲸鲵，不然刺蛟虯。\n缺落泥土中，委弃无人收。\n我有鄙介性，好刚不好柔。\n勿轻直折劒，犹胜曲全钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}